  "goodToKnow": "Das Freilichtmuseum is an open-air museum where historic buildings, often farmhouses, mills and workshops, are rebuilt and shown with crafts of the past. Germany has many, such as the LWL-Freilichtmuseum in Detmold and the Vogtsbauernhof in the Black Forest. Die Freilichtbühne is an open-air theatre. Note the plural -museen. Plural: die Freilichtmuseen."
